data: {"agent":"dsh","type":"thinking","text":"The question: \"接力台最该先做哪个功能?\" Answer in one sentence. Based on charter/plan, stage 1 is done; the biggest gap is hardware keyboard access (阶段 2.1), or rather... \"最该先做\" — the next thing. Given the charter's core value proposition: \"软件做不到的那一半：这些动作本身是'选择+发送'，应该闭着眼睛用手完成\" — the hardware direct access (S1–S5 接力、S7 复制、S8 拉群 via global hotkey) is the differentiating one. But plan currently has 1.x complete, 2.1 next.\n\nAlternatively, given \"候选功能\" maybe the question expects prioritizing among features. The key one is the hardware/global-hotkey direct relay — because the web page requires foreground, and the whole point of the hardware is hand-free operation.\n\nAnswer in one sentence."}

