data: {"agent":"codex","type":"raw","raw":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n '接力台|relay-deck|EasyInput' /Users/zach/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md\"","aggregated_output":"87:# Task Group: EasyInput hardware, firmware, and ESP-IDF validation workflow\n89:scope: Orient the EasyInput repos and firmware baseline, then distinguish verified host/build evidence from live device mapping and playback-demo troubleshooting.\n100:- EasyInput, easy-input-maker, project-flow-cy, easyinput-board-cy, esp-idf-cy, GPIO8, KEY_WAKE, CTest, idf.py build, ESP-IDF 5.5.5, v5.5.5-dirty\n112:- EnglishListening, English-Listening-Practice.mp4, English-Listening-Practice.srt, IINA 1.5.0, EasyInput英文精听-操作单.md, 方向②作业-用EasyInput把Mac变成英语精听台.md, KEY1, voice input, left-arrow keycode, EasyInput 0.1.42, 0.1.51, bootloader, development firmware\n124:- For the live demo, `/Users/zach/Movies/EnglishListening/English-Listening-Practice.mp4` and its paired `.srt` were verified to open/play in IINA; `EasyInput` still invoked built-in voice-editing behavior instead of the intended player event. Playback readiness and hardware event emission are separate checks. [Task 2] [skysight memory]\n125:- The observed EasyInput keyboard page mapped KEY1 to voice input, KEY2 to Enter, KEY3 to voice editing, KEY4 to Backspace, and KEY5–KEY8 to common edit actions. Version 0.1.42 -> 0.1.51 download/verification was started, not confirmed complete. [Task 2] [skysight memory]\n281:- imagegen, personalized-art, container, both sides, workflow, evidence, EasyInput, Mirror, Rivet, zach-personal-tin.png\n289:- The successful composition split process/workflow themes (“留值、证据、流程、Agent 协作”) from the creative world (“小游戏岛、EasyInput、Mirror、影像、海狸 Rivet”). [Task 1]\n471:- ThereisValue, 留值, source-grounded, provenance, Word-paragraph, source-drift, Python-standard-library, HomeGate, EasyInput, Mirror, 80-tests, local-only\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}

